 {
  "name": "Abele, Robert Jones",
  "note": "Robert Jones Abele is a native of Philadelphia and a graduate of the Institute for Colored Youth, class of 1891. Directly after leaving the I. C. Y., he taught school at Belair, Maryland, for one year, and then matriculated at the Hahnemann Medical College, Philadelphia, where he finished the course in the distinguished list."
 },
