 {
  "name": "Adger, William",
  "note": "William Adger, born in the city of Philadelphia, June 8, 1857. He received his early education at the I. C. Y., graduating with the brightest honors in 1875, after which he prepared himself for the University of Pennsylvania, entering the college department in 1879, and graduating with a B. A. degree in 1883."
 },
