 {
  "name": "Irvin, Helen Brooks",
  "note": "Helen Brooks Irvin, a graduate of the I. C. Y., is a member of the staff of teachers at Howard University, Washington, D. C. Miss Frazelia Campbell is a graduate of the I. C. Y., class '67, and has taught continuously since. Specialized in Latin, German and Spanish. Has gained an enviable reputation as a teacher and as a woman with great strength of character."
 },
